title: "Bitcoin Barometer: an honest, self-testing Bitcoin price forecast"
abstract: "Probabilistic Bitcoin price forecasts (7 to 180 days) with walk-forward validation, pre-registered hypotheses, a 2-year holdout exam, prediction-market benchmarking and a public virtual-trader journal, built on free public data and GitHub Actions."
